  "what_the_study_did": "The study investigated the use of a submerged 2-D cell culture model to predict acute inhalation toxicity.",
  "what_it_found": "A weak correlation was observed between in vitro cytotoxicity (IC50) and in vivo inhalation toxicity (LC50) for all substances tested. However, for semi-volatile and non-volatile organic compounds with high water solubility, the 2-D cell culture model showed excellent predictive ability for acute inhalation toxicity.",
